@startuml background_review
title 后台复盘：从已提交对话提取长期事实
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #4A6FA5

participant "TaskProcess" as Task
database "主数据库" as DB
participant "ReviewScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "ReviewProcess" as Review
participant "MemoryManager" as Memory
participant "ModelRuntime" as Runtime

note over Task: 主任务已 completed，回复和终态已经提交
opt 启用 review 且配置目标来源
    Task -> DB: ObserveReviewTurn：累计去重后的成功轮次
    alt 达到 every_turns 阈值
        DB --> Task: through_message_id
        Task ->> Scheduler: Schedule(session_id, through_message_id)
        note over Task: 主任务无需等待复盘执行
        Scheduler -> Review: 独立 worker 执行固定历史范围
        Review -> DB: 读取上次水位、新历史与只读锚点
        DB --> Review: expected 水位与已提交消息
        Review -> Memory: 读取授权来源原文、墓碑、类型与主题
        Memory --> Review: 事实原文、删除标记与主题目录
        Review -> Runtime: Run(复盘策略, 临时上下文)
        opt 有值得保存的新事实
            Runtime -> Memory: 经 memory 工具 list / search / add
            note over Memory: 新增引用本次范围的消息 ID，并指定或创建主题
            Memory --> Runtime: 原文与主题保存结果、index_status 与操作效果
        end
        Runtime --> Review: RunResult 与 tool_results
        alt 运行完成且工具均成功、效果可确认
            Review -> DB: AdvanceReview(expected, through_message_id)
            DB --> Review: 推进处理水位
        else 运行或写入失败
            Review -> Review: 返回失败状态，保留原水位
        end
        Review --> Scheduler: 本次复盘结果
    else 尚未达到阈值
        DB --> Task: 等待后续成功轮次
    end
end

note over Memory: 后台工具仅允许 list / search / add；禁止改删既有事实
note over Task, Scheduler: 复盘调度或执行失败不会改写已提交的主任务回复
@enduml
